  "label": "Biological incompatibility between species",
  "description": "The core joke is based on the biological fact that dogs and goats are different species and cannot reproduce with each other. This knowledge is necessary to understand why the statement 'you can't get her pregnant if she's a goat' is presented as a joke — it's a literal impossibility.",
